  triage:title "No test for batch time-budget deadline flush (BATCH_TIME_BUDGET = 2ms path)" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-rusqlite/src/writer/mod.rs — No test for batch time-budget deadline flush. The collect_batch function has a BATCH_TIME_BUDGET = 2ms path that is not covered by any test. T.3 FIX-R3 (6668842) added deadline_flush_commits_messages_without_waiting_for_batch_capacity which exercises this path. Fix has propagated to T.4 and T.5 but T.2 (d6f89e3) is still open and requires a merge-forward from T.3." ;
